<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13004] Fix wrong comparison in TcpCommunicationSpi#closeConnections(UUID)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13004</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12774&quot; title=&quot;Transaction hangs after too many open files NIO exception&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-12774&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-12774&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; was introduced a bug in comparison:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (ConnectionKey connKey : clientFuts.keySet()) {
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (!nodeId.equals(connKey))
                &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;continue&lt;/span&gt;; 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The right code is: &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (ConnectionKey connKey : clientFuts.keySet()) {
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (!nodeId.equals(connKey.nodeId()))
                &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;continue&lt;/span&gt;; 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
